<title>SOUTH AFRICA: POLL - South African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>POLL - South African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major</p>
<p>South African company results expected next week include the</p>
<p>following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY--PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>MON  AECI     H1 EPS  103.4	  92.0-113.0    79.0</p>
<p>MON  AECI     H1 DIV  30.3	   29.0-32.0     25.0</p>
<p>MON  Highveld H1 SHR  39.0	   37.0-45.0     41.5</p>
<p>MON  Highveld H1 DIV  15.7	   15.0-17.0     15.0</p>
<p>TUE  Stanbic  H1 EPS  705.9	  688.0-725.0   602.0</p>
<p>TUE  Stanbic  H1 DIV  130.3	  129.0-132.0   109.0</p>
<p>TUE  Amplats  YR EPS  174.0	  165.0-186.0   190.3</p>
<p>TUE  Amplats  YR DIV  122.5	  120.0-125.0   120.0</p>
